find-me:
Overview

Find Me is a mod for storing, summoning, and managing creatures and vehicles.



- You can register supported mounts and companions from vanilla Minecraft or other mods with Find Me, then quickly summon, switch, or recall them using radial wheels.
- Land, flying, and aquatic creatures use different approach animations when summoned;
- When switching mounts, the previous mount leaves while the new one actively approaches;
- When falling from a great height, players can also call a mount for an aerial rescue.




