- Issue follow, wait, guard, protect, and attack commands to individual creatures or entire teams;
- Use the Manager to organize teams, storage, and radial wheel slots;
- Assign companions to Nests and set them to rest, wander, or guard;
- Registered creatures are protected from fatal damage by entering a critical state. Stored creatures recover health

